abstract: >-
  A strategic Quality Engineering framework describing the evolution from
  conventional test automation to governed Agentic Quality Engineering. The
  work introduces an Automate-Assist-Orchestrate-Govern-Learn model that keeps
  deterministic automation as the execution backbone while adding bounded AI
  reasoning, specialized agents, typed orchestration, authoritative evidence,
  least-privilege tools, identity and authorization, human approval, agent
  evaluation, observability, risk-based release gates and
  production-to-regression learning.